OL,3,GNEWSAHeated discussions on town
OL,4,Acentre's future
OL,5,
OL,6,FHeated discussions between the public
OL,7,Fand bosses were had at a consultation
OL,8,Fon the future of a town.
OL,10,FA first look at plans to regenerate
OL,11,FBarrow town centre were unveiled this
OL,12,Fweek at consultation events, including
OL,13,Fideas for a new theatre and cultural
OL,14,Fquarter.
OL,16,FQuestions were asked about the Forum
OL,17,Ftheatre venue and Barrow Market, which
OL,18,Fclosed suddenly in 2023 over asbestos
OL,19,Fissues, and ranged from scrutiny of the
OL,20,Fdecision to demolish them to asking
OL,21,Fwhen a replacement would come.
OL,23,APub: 04-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NW Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
FL,402,400,260,160,0,100
