OL,3,GNEWSAHeated discussions on town
OL,4,Acentre's future
OL,5,
OL,6,FWestmorland and Furness Council's
OL,7,Fdirector of planning, regeneration and
OL,8,Fcommunities, Gareth Candlin, said a
OL,9,Ftheatre was one of the authority's
OL,10,F"ambitions" but it had to be
OL,11,Feconomically viable.
OL,23,APub: 04-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
